{'symbol': 'FBHS', 'date': '2020-12-08 16:15:00', 'title': 'FORTUNE BRANDS ELECTS JEFFERY PERRY TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FORTUNE BRANDS ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS ELECTED JEFFERY PERRY TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 8, 2020.'}{'symbol': 'FBHS', 'date': '2020-12-08 16:05:00', 'title': 'FORTUNE BRANDS INCREASES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND FOR 8TH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': 'DEERFIELD, ILL.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FORTUNE BRANDS HOME & SECURITY, INC. (NYSE: FBHS, THE “COMPANY”, OR “FORTUNE BRANDS”), AN INDUSTRY-LEADING HOME AND SECURITY PRODUCTS COMPANY, ANNOUNCED THAT TODAY, DECEMBER 8, 2020, ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.26 PER COMMON SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON MARCH 17, 2021, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON FEBRUARY 26, 2021. THE 8 PERCENT INCREASE IN THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, FROM $0.24 TO $0.26, REP'}